{"name":"Love Vessel","hex":"#ee0099","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"love","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A deep caring for the existence of another.","Strong affection."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To have a strong affection for (someone or something).","To need, thrive on."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/love"},{"term":"vessel","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A craft for transportation on or in water, air, or space.\n  Any craft designed for transportation on or in water, such as a ship, boat, or submarine. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","Any craft designed for transportation on or in water, such as a ship, boat, or submarine. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To put into a vessel."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/vessel"}],"entries":[{"title":"Vessel (structure)","blocks":[{"text":"Vessel is a 16-story, 150-foot-tall (46 m) structure of connected staircases in the 5-acre (2.0 ha) Hudson Yards Public Square of Hudson Yards in Manhattan, New York City. Designed by Thomas Heatherwick, the elaborate honeycomb-like structure consists of 154 flights of stairs, 2,500 steps, and 80 landings for visitors to climb. Funded by Hudson Yards developer Related Companies, its final cost was estimated at $200 million."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Hudson_Yards_Plaza_March_2019_53.jpg/330px-Hudson_Yards_Plaza_March_2019_53.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vessel_(structure)","wikidata":"Q27988215"},{"title":"Love","blocks":[{"text":"Love encompasses a range of strong and positive emotional and mental states, from the most sublime virtue or good habit, the deepest interpersonal affection, to the simplest pleasure. An example of this range of meanings is that the love of a mother differs from the love of a spouse, which differs from the love for food. Most commonly, love refers to a feeling of strong attraction and emotional attachment."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love","wikidata":"Q316"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/HudsonYards_05-06-19-1_%2847003439824%29.jpg/500px-HudsonYards_05-06-19-1_%2847003439824%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/HudsonYards_05-06-19-1_%2847003439824%29.jpg/1280px-HudsonYards_05-06-19-1_%2847003439824%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/HudsonYards_05-06-19-1_%2847003439824%29.jpg/500px-HudsonYards_05-06-19-1_%2847003439824%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Viewed from 11th Avenue (2019)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHudsonYards_05-06-19-1_(47003439824).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Hudson_Yards_May_2017_40_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Hudson_Yards_May_2017_40_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Hudson_Yards_May_2017_40_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Hudson_Yards_May_2017_40_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Hudson_Yards_May_2017_40_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Hudson_Yards_May_2017_40_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Beginning of construction, May 2017","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHudson_Yards_May_2017_40_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Hudson_Yards_Plaza_March_2019_27.jpg/330px-Hudson_Yards_Plaza_March_2019_27.jpg?utm_sourc